<title>USA: American International no comment on Brazil rumors.</title>
<headline>American International no comment on Brazil rumors.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>American International Group Inc Wednesday declined to comment on industry rumors that it might buy a stake in, or begin a joint venture in insurance, with Brazil's Unibanco Group SA.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't comment on rumors,&quot; an American International Group spokesman said.</p>
<p>Unibanco ADRs rosed 1-10/16 to 40-1/16 on the New York Stock Exchange. American International Group eased 3/8 to 152-3/8.</p>
